  "prefLabel": "Juv 204.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Juv 204.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to provide a uniform procedure for the conduct of public hearings as which comment from the general public will be solicited for evaluation and consideration by the board relative to rulemaking.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Juv 200) #7843-A, eff 3-6-03",
